Creates a time distortion in a radius of [2, 2, 2, 3, 3 (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] that lasts for [6, 7, 8, 9, 10 (TL1-5; PARADOX 300)] turns, decreasing global speed by 60% for 3 turns and inflicting [35, 47, 56, 64, 71 (TL1-5; SP 100; PARADOX 300)] temporal damage each turn to all targets within the area.

The slow effect and damage dealt will scale with your Spellpower.
